---
---
<!-- 6. WHAT WE BELIEVE (Editorial Core Values) -->
<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-10 sm:mb-16 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      <div>
        <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-primary uppercase mb-2 sm:mb-3 block">OUR VALUES</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          THE PRINCIPLES BEHIND EVERY PROJECT.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
        Integrity in construction is invisible at first glance. It resides inside the reinforced concrete, behind the drywall, and within the ethical standards of the builders.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- 4-Column Grid with Large Numbers -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div>
          <span class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 sm:mb-6 block">01</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Quality</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Quality must be considered holistically from day zero: structural footing depth, calibrated mix ratios, and mill-certified materials through to sub-millimeter finishing reveals.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-high text-xs font-medium text-outline">
          Zero-tolerance tolerances
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div>
          <span class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 sm:mb-6 block">02</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Transparency</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Clients must clearly understand what is being built, which specific brand grades are being procured, and exactly where their finances and timeline stand at every milestone.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-high text-xs font-medium text-outline">
          Open-book governance
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div>
          <span class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 sm:mb-6 block">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Responsibility</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            One unified team carries ownership of the complete journey. When unexpected challenges arise on site, we solve them proactively rather than shifting blame across trades.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-high text-xs font-medium text-outline">
          Single-point accountability
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div>
          <span class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 sm:mb-6 block">04</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Craftsmanship</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Every millimeter matters. From stone veining alignment and flush-ceiling shadowlines to acoustic insulation, uncompromising craftsmanship gives space its enduring soul.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-high text-xs font-medium text-outline">
          Architectural permanence
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
